---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
---

<section class="container">
  <div class="grid">
    <article>
      <SectionTitle tag="p">ARCHITECTURE</SectionTitle>
      <h2>
        I ARCHITECT LARGE-SCALE ENTERPRISE WEB APPLICATIONS TO SHIP ROBUST
        SOLUTIONS THAT ARE <span class="highlight-p">SAFE & MAINTAINABLE</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        My role includes aligning cross-functional teams — defining technology
        stacks and establishing best practices. I focus on building the backend
        of the frontend, guiding my team through complex challenges to deliver
        reliable, future-proof web applications.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <SectionTitle tag="p" signalVariant="yellow">UI ENGINEERING</SectionTitle>
      <h2>
        I ENGINEER DETAIL-RICH USER INTERFACES TO SHIP MEANINGFUL SOLUTIONS THAT
        ARE <span class="highlight-y">EASY TO USE & ENJOYABLE</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        My work bridges design and engineering — translating complex
        requirements into user-centric, visually polished and accessible
        experiences. I collaborate closely with designers to ensure every
        interaction and component is thoughtfully crafted and seamless for the
        user.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-l);
    }
  }

  article {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    & h2 {
      font-size: var(--font-step-2);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-block: var(--space-m) var(--space-s);
    }
  }

  .highlight-p {
    color: var(--color-p300);
  }

  .highlight-y {
    color: var(--color-y100);
  }
</style>
